#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trademasters"
msgstr "Maestros del comercio"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginians were broadly known for their extensive trade over the "
"Mediterranean Sea."
msgstr "Los cartagineses eran ampliamente conocidos por su gran actividad comercial en el mar Mediterráneo."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trade ships are available in the Village Phase."
msgstr "Los navíos mercantes están disponibles en la fase inicial."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Mining Economy"
msgstr "Economía de minas"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginian economy was centered around mining, with stone comprising "
"much of Carthage's structures."
msgstr "La economía cartaginesa se centraba en la minería, siendo la piedra un elemento fundamental de las estructuras cartaginesas. "

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Stone mining technologies are free and instant."
msgstr "Las tecnologías de extracción de piedra son gratuitas desde el comienzo."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Numidian Cavalry"
msgstr "Caballería númida"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Numidian cavalry's horses, ancestors of the Berber horse, were small "
"compared with other horses of the era, and were well adapted for faster "
"movement over long distances."
msgstr "Los caballos de la caballería númida, antepasados del caballo bereber, eran pequeños en comparación con otros caballos de la época y estaban bien adaptados para desplazarse con rapidez en trayectos largos."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Cavalry Javelineers +10% walk speed."
msgstr "Caballería con jabalina (Velocidad de movimiento: +10%)."

